@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-the-access-token-returned-by-verify
@email = hirer@example.test
@code = paste-the-six-digit-code
@profileId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@gigId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@bookmarkId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@threadId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
@recipientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
@reviewId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007

### Public configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/config

### Request an email code; Development shows a clearly labeled test code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/code
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Verify ownership, sign in, and copy accessToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","code":"{{code}}","name":"Aanya Shah"}

### Google ID token, obtained using your configured client ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{"idToken":"replace-with-a-google-id-token"}

### Mobile: create a one-minute grant after browser login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/mobile/grant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"challenge":"replace-with-a-43-character-base64url-SHA256-proof-key"}

### Mobile: exchange with original verifier; invalid proof or replay returns 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/mobile/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"replace-with-the-returned-code","verifier":"replace-with-the-original-native-verifier"}

### Current account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit account name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Aanya Shah"}

### Switch context; the same account can perform both roles
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"Working"}

### Discover talent. Omit Authorization to check the three-item preview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles?q=&category=&city=Mumbai&available=true&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public talent profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/{{profileId}}

### Current user's talent profile (null if not created)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Five-question onboarding / edit profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"headline":"Acoustic musician for intimate events","category":"Music & Performance","city":"Mumbai","rate":5000,"rateUnit":"per gig","bio":"I bring warm acoustic sets to weddings, small gatherings, and thoughtful celebrations.","skills":["Acoustic guitar","Live music"],"photos":[],"available":true}

### Discover open gigs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs?city=Mumbai&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public gig details (missing IDs return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs/{{gigId}}

### Own posted gigs, independent of current mode
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/gigs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a gig; dates use ISO calendar dates; null is unspecified
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Acoustic band for a family celebration","category":"Music & Performance","city":"Mumbai","description":"We need a warm acoustic set for a small family celebration. Please share your experience and availability.","date":null,"budget":15000,"photos":[]}

### Edit your open gig (dates cannot change once people have applied)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs/{{gigId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Acoustic band for a family celebration","category":"Music & Performance","city":"Mumbai","description":"Updated brief: an intimate unplugged set for a small family celebration. Let’s discuss the details.","date":null,"budget":16000,"photos":[]}

### Close your open gig, notifying active applicants
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs/{{gigId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Today's three-application allowance (Asia/Kolkata)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/allowance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Apply as another account with a talent profile; fourth application returns 429
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs/{{gigId}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"I have experience with intimate acoustic events and would love to discuss your celebration.","expectedPrice":12000}

### Own applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One application: applicant or owning hirer only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Applicants to your gig; another hirer gets 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs/{{gigId}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hirer status change: Shortlisted, Booked, or Declined
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Booked"}

### Applicant withdrawal; does not refund daily allowance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hirer explicitly confirms completion (future dates return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gigs/{{gigId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Completed-only, owning-hirer review; repeats return 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId":"{{applicationId}}","rating":5,"text":"A thoughtful performance and great communication throughout the celebration."}

### Public genuine reviews for a talent profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/{{profileId}}/reviews

### One public review
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{reviewId}}

### Saved talent and gigs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookmarks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a profile; repeated saves are idempotent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookmarks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"targetType":"profile","targetId":"{{profileId}}"}

### Read your own bookmark
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookmarks/{{bookmarkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove your bookmark
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookmarks/{{bookmarkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/threads/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start or resume a matching conversation (gigId can be null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/threads/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipientId":"{{recipientId}}","gigId":null,"message":"Hello! Could we discuss your availability for an upcoming project?"}

### Participants only; latest 200 messages, marks returned incoming messages read
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/threads/{{threadId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a reply
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/threads/{{threadId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Thanks for getting in touch. Tell me a little more about your project."}

### Activity updates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/updates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark all existing activity read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/updates/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload a JPEG/PNG/WebP up to 5 MB. Replace the file path before sending.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GygBoundary

--GygBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="portfolio.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./portfolio.jpg
--GygBoundary--

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Public image (replace with the path returned by an upload).
# Supabase mode redirects to persistent public storage; Local mode serves the file.
GET {{baseUrl}}/uploads/00000000000000000000000000000000.jpg

### Development OpenAPI schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
